  "threshold_policy": "ROC formal — Youden's J max with constraints (random FAIL ≥ 0.95 ∧ chat-cap PASS ≥ 0.7); stricter (higher thr for direction='ge', lower for 'le') of paradigm-a-prime vs clm_v4 baselines.",
  "aggregation_rule_ssot": {
    "decision": "per_prompt_n_of_m_06_AND_emc_3_of_4",
    "spec": ".own own 18 c3-aggregation-rule-v2 mirror — PPR_v2 (per-prompt ≥3 of 4 cells PASS) verdict rate ≥ 0.6 AND EMC_v2 (cell-mean ≥3 of 4 cells satisfy threshold) PASS = C3 PASS. iter3 d-retry SSOT 를 iter4 (d) 결정한 P5 rule 로 retrofit.",
    "rationale": [
